WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:04.660
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: Dr. Bright is not

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:07.710
allowed to edit the list of things he is not
allowed to do!

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:12.629
Due to some unsubstantiated rumors perpetuated
by Dr. Bright himself, we must issue a formal

00:00:12.629 --> 00:00:14.119
correction.

00:00:14.119 --> 00:00:18.000
If an SCP file says never to do something,
that is not because we are trying to control

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.040
your mind.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:24.170
For example, warnings not to look at SCP-096’s
face are for your own protection.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:28.030
If you would like to look at its face and
bring about your own untimely end, then that

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:32.009
is up to you, but don’t say we didn’t
warn you.

00:00:32.009 --> 00:00:33.399
AHEM!

00:00:33.399 --> 00:00:35.740
No, we are not.

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:37.520
Dr. Bright, I see you.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:42.060
You can’t type into this script any more,
your IP address has already been blocked!

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:46.489
In conclusion, if he would let us get our
work done for once in his miserable endless

00:00:46.489 --> 00:00:51.820
life, Dr. Bright is not allowed to attempt
any manipulation, mind control, or subterfuge

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:55.809
of any kind via official SCP Foundation documents.

